{"about_the_game":"Embark on a journey alongside once mighty and generous, now the forgotten god, whose energy slowly dissipates from the world. Betrayed by his human apprentice who decided to become a new divine by sacrificing his master, the Divine Spirit initially distrusts humanity until witnessing their bravery in defending against darkness. Before going to the void God is ready to make his last call to save humankind.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EMBRACE THE MANTLE OF COMMANDER</h2>Lead a squad of brave adventurers through a war-torn world besieged by darkness. Engage in meticulously crafted turn-based battles spanning four captivating chapters, where green recruits evolve into seasoned warriors.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2927700/extras/2fec2765c0253f79b2c516c53271f9fe.poster.avif?t=1757771089\" width=620 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2927700/extras/2fec2765c0253f79b2c516c53271f9fe.webm?t=1757771089\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2927700/extras/2fec2765c0253f79b2c516c53271f9fe.mp4?t=1757771089\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >USE YOUR STRATEGIC AND TACTICAL SKILLS</h2>Challenge your strategic prowess as you navigate through tactical encounters, devising maneuvers, launching assaults, and striving to tip the scales of the conflict in your favor. Witness the transformation of your ragtag group into legendary heroes, forged from humble beginnings into mythical champions.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2927700/extras/b2801cffa5a029dccb9e287dd9e4cdc5.poster.avif?t=1757771089\" width=620 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2927700/extras/b2801cffa5a029dccb9e287dd9e4cdc5.webm?t=1757771089\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2927700/extras/b2801cffa5a029dccb9e287dd9e4cdc5.mp4?t=1757771089\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD YOUR SQUAD OF RECRUITS</h2>Invest in the growth of your team, meticulously nurturing their skills and resilience to endure the harrowing trials ahead. Every decision counts as you strive to carve a path of hope amidst a bleak and seemingly insurmountable crisis.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2927700/extras/d867948bb248efa7d54b67884582ead7.poster.avif?t=1757771089\" width=620 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2927700/extras/d867948bb248efa7d54b67884582ead7.webm?t=1757771089\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2927700/extras/d867948bb248efa7d54b67884582ead7.mp4?t=1757771089\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2927700?t=1757771089","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2927700?t=1757771089","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2927700/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757771089","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2927700/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757771089","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2993480,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>CHECK OUT AND WISHLIST FIGHT LIFE: VANGUARD PROLOGUE - RELEASE IN AUGUST 2025</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2927700/extras/4de7db04cef94fa0c2e8d8971f9d50fb.avif?t=1757771089\" width=800 height=294 /></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Embark on a journey alongside once mighty and generous, now the forgotten god, whose energy slowly dissipates from the world. Betrayed by his human apprentice who decided to become a new divine by sacrificing his master, the Divine Spirit initially distrusts humanity until witnessing their bravery in defending against darkness. Before going to the void God is ready to make his last call to save humankind.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EMBRACE THE MANTLE OF COMMANDER</h2>Lead a squad of brave adventurers through a war-torn world besieged by darkness. Engage in meticulously crafted turn-based battles spanning four captivating chapters, where green recruits evolve into seasoned warriors.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2927700/extras/2fec2765c0253f79b2c516c53271f9fe.poster.avif?t=1757771089\" width=620 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2927700/extras/2fec2765c0253f79b2c516c53271f9fe.webm?t=1757771089\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2927700/extras/2fec2765c0253f79b2c516c53271f9fe.mp4?t=1757771089\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >USE YOUR STRATEGIC AND TACTICAL SKILLS</h2>Challenge your strategic prowess as you navigate through tactical encounters, devising maneuvers, launching assaults, and striving to tip the scales of the conflict in your favor. Witness the transformation of your ragtag group into legendary heroes, forged from humble beginnings into mythical champions.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2927700/extras/b2801cffa5a029dccb9e287dd9e4cdc5.poster.avif?t=1757771089\" width=620 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2927700/extras/b2801cffa5a029dccb9e287dd9e4cdc5.webm?t=1757771089\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2927700/extras/b2801cffa5a029dccb9e287dd9e4cdc5.mp4?t=1757771089\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD YOUR SQUAD OF RECRUITS</h2>Invest in the growth of your team, meticulously nurturing their skills and resilience to endure the harrowing trials ahead. Every decision counts as you strive to carve a path of hope amidst a bleak and seemingly insurmountable crisis.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2927700/extras/d867948bb248efa7d54b67884582ead7.poster.avif?t=1757771089\" width=620 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2927700/extras/d867948bb248efa7d54b67884582ead7.webm?t=1757771089\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2927700/extras/d867948bb248efa7d54b67884582ead7.mp4?t=1757771089\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","developers":["StartImpulse","Two Cakes Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2927700/header.jpg?t=1757771089","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2024 Original version developed by StartImpulse, Steam version developed and published by Two Cakes Studio.","linux_requirements":[]